      <h1 id="adding-vsphere-compute-user-infra" class="group scroll-mt-20">Adding compute machines to vSphere manually<a href="#adding-vsphere-compute-user-infra" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p>You can add more compute machines to your OpenShift Container Platform cluster on VMware vSphere manually.</p>
      <h2 id="adding-vsphere-compute-user-infra_adding-vsphere-compute-user-infra" class="group scroll-mt-20">Prerequisites<a href="#adding-vsphere-compute-user-infra_adding-vsphere-compute-user-infra" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">There are several prerequisites that must be completed before you add more compute machines to your OpenShift Container Platform cluster on VMware vSphere manually.</p>
      <Alert variant="note" class="my-4">
        <AlertTitle>Note</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
