        </AlertDescription>
      </Alert>
      <p>The following prerequisites must be met:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>You <a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/installing/installing_vsphere/upi/installing-vsphere#installing-vsphere">installed a cluster on vSphere</a>.</li>
      <li>You have installation media and Red Hat Enterprise Linux CoreOS (RHCOS) images that you used to create your cluster. If you do not have these files, you must obtain them by following the instructions in the <a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/installing/installing_vsphere/upi/installing-vsphere#installing-vsphere">installation procedure</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      <Alert variant="info" class="my-4">
