      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>&lt;csr_name&gt;</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Specifies the name of a CSR from the list of current CSRs. *   To approve all pending CSRs, run the following command:</p></dd>
